**/Recordings/

# Visual Studio / VS Code generated files
**/*.csproj
**/*.unityproj
**/*.sln
**/*.suo
**/*.user
**/*.userprefs
**/*.pidb
**/*.booproj
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
